      "mergeID": "6619385ef5cbdbb1d027d9e1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "So Avatar's on PC have audio right?\nWhat if we could have audio on quest as well?\nThis would be a really awesome feature for quest!!!\nimagine being able to toggle audio on and off for both platforms.\nLike say if you wanted to listen to a certain audio on an avatar but you can't because your on Quest.\nI think this would be a feature loved by all of VRchat's Quest user's like myself.",
