      "value": "@{635554d27671744504db56de|full_name}: actually, it is. Running multiple audio sources on Quest is very taxing. You can actually crash quest players intentionally just by having too many players in an instance all talking at the same time. Converting bits into audio data uses resources, more than you would think.",
